<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60366" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτήσ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτῆσις</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belonging to property</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήματα κ.</span>
			<i>property</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1009
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. βοτόν</span> a sheep
				<i>of one's own flock</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				690
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>domestic</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς κ.</span>
			<i>the protector of house and property</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				445
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Insomn.</u>
				89
			</span></i>, Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				1.16
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς κ. Δίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anticl.
					13
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηνᾶ κ.</span> Hp.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ θεὸς ὁ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.828a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. βωμός</span> the altar <i>of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς κτήσιος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1038
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὶ κ.</span>, =
			Lat. <u>Penates</u>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				8.41
			</span></i>.</div>
